flowchart TD
  PO[Platform Owner authorized] --> CREATE[Create organization transaction]
  CREATE --> INV[Invite organization owner expiring token]
  INV --> ACCEPT[Owner authenticates & accepts]
  ACCEPT --> BRAND[Set profile, logo, theme, legal contacts]
  BRAND --> EVENT[Create event and edition]
  EVENT --> CMS[Fill agenda, guests, FAQs and ticket link]
  CMS --> PVIEW[Private preview + editorial checks]
  PVIEW --> SUB[Activate platform subdomain]
  SUB --> OPT{Optional custom domain?}
  OPT -->|yes| DNS[Verify ownership, DNS, SSL]
  DNS --> CERT{Ready and approved?}
  CERT -->|yes| PUB[Publish site]
  CERT -->|no| HOLD[Hold activation; keep subdomain]
  OPT -->|no| PUB
  PUB --> OPS[Operational support / monitoring]
